{"schema":"x-post-1","post_id":"2052935472087957542","user_id":"1027041315110842368","handle":"chickengenius","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:15:32.000Z","kind":"original","text":"If you’re looking at others posting screenshots and celebrating.\nThis is the part of the cycle called the winner’s curse.\n\nMarket's going up not because of fundamentals, one reason is MM covering for calls purchased.\n\nBefore you click “buy” at the top, remember:\nThis is not a sprint, it’s a lifelong journey.\nSurvive long enough, and you’ll make it.\nThat’s time doing its job. Not you.\n\nYou’ve seen me go through two full cycles publicly. I’m never the “best” in any single cycle, but I outperform the “best” over a long enough period.\n\nIt’s my believe we will run it hot, but volatility will always, ALWAYS come back to roost. Game of musical chairs.\n\nWill I can’t promise outperformance always, I’ll do my best. Always transparent, public and no paid wall.","text_source":"note_tweet","lang":"en","conversation_id":"2052935472087957542","in_reply_to_post_id":null,"in_reply_to_user_id":null,"self_thread":false,"quoted_post_id":null,"reposted_post_id":null,"referenced":[],"entities":{"cashtags":[],"hashtags":[],"mentions":[],"urls":[]},"media":[{"media_key":"3_2052934986404331520","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HH19fkOaAAA_0UX.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1100,"height":653,"alt_text":""},{"media_key":"3_2052934986056245248","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HH19fi7aoAA9_Xz.jpg","preview_url":"","width":1102,"height":650,"alt_text":""}],"edit":{"history_ids":["2052935472087957542"],"is_earliest":true},"metrics_first_seen":{"likes":1173,"reposts":38,"replies":87,"quotes":2,"views":104925,"bookmarks":135,"observed_at":"2026-11-22T08:03:30.681Z"},"fetched_via":"web_graphql","fidelity":"full","first_seen_at":"2026-11-22T08:03:30.681Z"}
